{
  "$comment": "Canonical JSON vectors (see test/canonical-vectors.test.ts). `text` is what a verifier parses; `canonical` and `sha256` are what src/core/db/event-write.ts canonicalStringify makes of JSON.parse(text). Both verifiers must produce exactly these bytes. Regenerate the expected values with REDLOG_WRITE_CANONICAL_VECTORS=1 npx vitest run test/canonical-vectors.test.ts.",
